package market

// QuoteFeedVenue is the venue of the stocks priced from the keyless Yahoo
// feed (quotefeed.go) instead of a perp: HSDT, US-listed Asian ADRs and stocks,
// and Asian local listings converted to USD at Yahoo FX.
const QuoteFeedVenue = "yahoo"

// QuoteFeed reports whether the asset is a quote-feed stock: priced, charted
// and filled from Yahoo, in USD, following its listing's regular session.
func (a AssetInfo) QuoteFeed() bool { return a.Venue == QuoteFeedVenue }

// QuoteFeeds are appended to Universe after every perp, in this order. Pair is
// the Yahoo ticker. Admitted 2026-10-06 (rule and exclusions in the contract):
// Yahoo serves the ticker as EQUITY, at least 250 daily bars, and at least $1M
// mean 30-day traded value (volume × close × FX); ordinary shares or ADRs only.
// An ADS ratio is stated only where live prices confirmed it that day. The
// Singapore, Taiwan and Korea rows after them were measured the same day by the
// same rule, leaving out REITs and business trusts, duplicate exposure, and a
// local line whose ADR passes (the ADR is kept).
